flowchart TD

    subgraph Baseline_PPlug
      A1[Input Text + Profile History IDs]
      B1[Task Embedding via emb_model -BGE]
      C1[Profile Embeddings Lookup -Frozen BGE Table]
      D1[Align MLP → LLM Space]
      E1[Inject Profile Embs into Frozen Flan-T5 Tokens]
      F1[Flan-T5 Forward Pass]
      G1[Output -Numeric Rating]

      A1 --> B1
      B1 --> C1
      C1 --> D1
      D1 --> E1
      E1 --> F1
      F1 --> G1
    end

    subgraph Extended_PPlug
      A2[Input Text + Profile IDs + Session IDs + Graph Node IDs]
      B2[Task Embedding via emb_model -BGE]
      C2[Profile Emb Lookup -Frozen BGE Table]
      S2[Session Emb Lookup + Transformer Encoder]
      GN2[Graph Emb Lookup -Frozen GNN Table]
      M2[Fuse via Gated Cross-Attention with Task Embs]
      E2[Inject Fused Embs into Frozen Flan-T5 Tokens]
      F2[Flan-T5 Forward Pass]
      H2[Output -Numeric Rating]
      A2 --> B2
      B2 --> C2
      A2 --> S2
      A2 --> GN2
      C2 --> M2
      S2 --> M2
      GN2 --> M2
      M2 --> E2
      E2 --> F2
      F2 --> H2
    end